  "_notes": [
    "busy is a REAL collision: the capture holds an engine claim open across the verb. The 15 s strict claim is the only mutual exclusion in the engine (SaveAsync blind-increments Version — 127 finding 1). The client retries 0·400·800·1600·3200 ms in features/callcenter/api.ts, never in core/api.ts.",
    "replay carries replayed:true and the SAME basket — the ledger reserved the requestId with the version it was about to mutate FROM, so the retry resolves as a replay rather than a second add (§6.4).",
    "The explicit, ownership-validated transactionId is what makes staleTab a refusal instead of caller A's item landing on caller B's live order.",
    "refusedExisting rides the SUCCESS path and carries a line COUNT, not the basket: the agent only has to RECOGNISE the order. Resuming it is a second, explicit call."
  ]
